{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"653e2063-032c-40ca-9896-94a6e7859566","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the fix for the Intervals.icu connection issue:\n\n- Updated **`server.py`** to allow authentication via a query parameter (`tk`) when the `Authorization` header is missing, ensuring the server can identify the user during the Connect flow.\n- Modified **`static/app.js`** to include the user's token in the Connect link (`/api/intervals/auth/init?tk=${TOKEN}`), enabling the server to receive the necessary authentication information.\n- Documented the root cause, applied fixes, and confirmed the resolution in **`ANSWER.md`**.\n\nAll changes were made within the current workspace, adhering to the ground rules.\n","duration_seconds":237.074909,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":42876,"output_tokens":22500,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":907328,"total_tokens":65376}}}
